    "description": "Otter, Fireflies, Fathom or Granola? Verdicts by meeting need, Otter pricing checked on the vendor's site, and who should skip it.",
    "checked": "2026-10-20",
    "body": "**The short answer:** for transcribing meetings and turning them into notes, our pick is **Otter.ai** (94% match on [/best/meetings](https://bestbotfor.com/best/meetings)). Transcription and notes are the job, and the free Basic plan works with Zoom, Microsoft Teams and Google Meet. If you don't want a bot joining your calls, look at **Granola**. For free unlimited recordings, look at **Fathom**.\n\n[Get a pick in 30 seconds](https://bestbotfor.com/).\n\n## Verdict by use case\n\n| If your job is... | Start with | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| Transcripts and notes for Zoom, Teams and Meet calls | **Otter.ai** | Transcription and notes are the job |\n| Reliable notes across many meeting platforms | Fireflies.ai | Works across Zoom, Meet and Teams |\n| A free start with unlimited recordings | Fathom | Free unlimited recordings |\n| Notes without a bot joining the call | Granola | No bot joins; notes stay yours |\n| Linking meeting notes to email and chat | Read AI | Ties notes to your inbox and chats |\n| Affordable multilingual transcription | Notta | Many languages at a lower price |\n\n## Our pick: Otter.ai\n\n**Match for this job:** 94%. **Our rating:** 3.9, #5 of 7 in Meetings. **Skill level:** beginner.\n\n**Why the match and the rating differ:** match measures how directly Otter matches transcription and notes. The overall rating compares it with every meeting tool across price, limits and features, and some rivals score higher there.\n\nOtter joins or ingests the call and gives you a transcript, with speaker identification, AI chat across meetings and summaries. It isn't a general writing suite.\n\n**Visit:** [Otter.ai](https://bestbotfor.com/go/otter?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=meetings)\n\n### Pricing (verified on the vendor's site)\n\nSource: [otter.ai/pricing](https://otter.ai/pricing), **checked October 20, 2026**. Prices are in USD, per user.\n\n| Plan | Billed monthly | Billed annually | Key limits |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Basic | Free | Free | 300 transcription minutes a month; 3 lifetime file imports |\n| Pro | $16.99/mo | $8.33/mo | 1,200 in-app recording minutes a month; 10 file imports a month; up to 90 minutes per meeting |\n| Business | $30/mo | $19.99/mo | Unlimited meetings and recordings; up to 4 hours per meeting; admin features; 3 concurrent meetings |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom | SSO and SCIM, HIPAA add-on, API and webhooks |\n\n**Promotions shown on October 20, 2026:** Pro at a further 50% off ($8.49 monthly, $4.17 annual) and Business at 20% off for 3 months ($24 monthly). The page says offers are \"valid for first-time subscribers only\". Promotions change, so don't quote these as standing prices.\n\n### Who should skip Otter\n\n- **You don't want a bot joining calls.** Granola takes notes without one.\n- **You record long meetings on the free plan.** Basic caps you at 300 minutes a month. Fathom advertises free unlimited recordings.\n- **You import lots of recorded files.** Pro allows 10 imports a month and Basic only 3 in total.\n- **You need many languages at a low price.** Notta is aimed there.\n\n## The alternatives\n\nPrices for these weren't re-checked on each vendor's site for this guide. See our live [/best/meetings](https://bestbotfor.com/best/meetings) page (October 20, 2026).\n\n**Fireflies.ai: 88% match.** Reliable meeting notes across Zoom, Meet and Teams. [Visit Fireflies.ai](https://bestbotfor.com/go/fireflies?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=meetings)\n\n**Fathom: 86% match.** Free unlimited recordings make it an easy start. [Visit Fathom](https://bestbotfor.com/go/fathom?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=meetings)\n\n**Granola: 86% match.** No bot joins the call; notes stay yours. [Visit Granola](https://bestbotfor.com/go/granola?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=meetings)\n\n**Read AI: 80% match.** Ties meeting notes to your inbox and chats. [Visit Read AI](https://bestbotfor.com/go/read-ai?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=meetings)\n\n**Notta: 78% match.** Affordable transcription in many languages. [Visit Notta](https://bestbotfor.com/go/notta?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=meetings)\n\n## FAQ\n\n**Is Otter.ai free?** Yes. The Basic plan is free with 300 transcription minutes a month, per otter.ai/pricing on October 20, 2026.\n\n**How much is Otter Pro?** $16.99 per user per month billed monthly, or $8.33 billed annually, before any first-time-subscriber promotion.\n\n**Did you test these tools?** No. Our scores are research-based, built from vendor pages, docs, leaderboards and published reviews.\n\n## What we checked\n\n- **Vendor pricing:** [otter.ai/pricing](https://otter.ai/pricing), fetched October 20, 2026 (ET).\n- **Our live ranking:** [bestbotfor.com/best/meetings](https://bestbotfor.com/best/meetings), fetched October 20, 2026. The page shows \"Last reviewed Oct 15, 2026\".\n- **Our catalog and scores:** as of October 20, 2026. Otter review date: October 16, 2026.\n- **Not checked for this guide:** alternative vendors' pricing pages.\n\n## How we rank (read this first)\n\n- **Match** is how well a tool matches this one job in our research. **Our rating** is a separate overall score for the tool against its category. A tool can be the strongest match for a job and still carry a middling overall rating, and we show both.\n- **Scores are research-based, not hands-on testing.** We build them from vendor pricing and product pages, documentation, public leaderboards and published reviews. We did not test these tools ourselves.\n- **Rankings are our own.** Sponsors never affect them, and payment never buys a higher rank. Sponsored placements are labeled and kept out of rankings.\n- **Links:** \"Visit\" links go through bestbotfor.com/go, which logs the click and sends you to the vendor's site. Some of those links may be affiliate links, and we may earn a commission. That never changes our picks or rankings.\n"
