    "description": "Runway, Synthesia, HeyGen or Descript? Verdicts by video job, Runway pricing checked on the vendor's site, and who should skip it.",
    "checked": "2026-10-20",
    "body": "**The short answer:** for generating shots and editing footage with AI, our pick is **Runway** (92% match on [/best/video](https://bestbotfor.com/best/video)). For a talking-head presenter reading a script, choose **Synthesia** or **HeyGen**. To cut long recordings into shorts, choose **OpusClip**. To edit a recording by editing its transcript, choose **Descript**.\n\n[Get a pick for your video job in 30 seconds](https://bestbotfor.com/).\n\n## Verdict by use case\n\n| If your job is... | Start with | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| Generative shots, motion, and AI edits to footage | **Runway** | Generative shots and video edits, not a slide-to-presenter tool |\n| Script to talking-head presenter video | Synthesia | That's the product |\n| Avatar videos and translating videos | HeyGen | Avatar video and translation without a film crew |\n| Cinematic text-to-video and image-to-video | Luma Dream Machine | Strong for cinematic generation |\n| Long podcasts or streams into shorts | OpusClip | Built for repurposing |\n| Editing a recording that already exists | Descript | Edit the transcript, edit the video |\n| Training videos for L&D teams | Colossyan | Built for L&D |\n\n## Our pick: Runway\n\n**Match for this job:** 92%. **Our rating:** 3.5, #1 of 3 in Video (generators). **Skill level:** intermediate.\n\nRunway is for making or altering moving images, not for a corporate presenter reading a script. Expect to iterate on each clip: it's a creative tool with a learning curve. Its plans also cover AI images and audio on the same credit balance, using a range of models listed on the pricing page.\n\n**Visit:** [Runway](https://bestbotfor.com/go/runway?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=video)\n\n### Pricing (verified on the vendor's site)\n\nSource: [runway.com/pricing](https://runway.com/pricing), Individual tab, **checked October 20, 2026**.\n\n| Plan | Billed monthly | Billed yearly | Credits |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Free | $0 | $0 | 125 one-time credits (don't expire) |\n| Standard | $15/mo | $12/mo | 625 per month |\n| Pro | $35/mo | $28/mo | 2,250 per month |\n| Max | $95/mo | $76/mo | 9,500 per month; up to 1 month of unused credits rolls over |\n\n**What credits buy, per the vendor's page:** Gen-4.5 video uses 60 credits per 5 seconds, and the page estimates about 125 Gen-4.5 videos a year on Standard. Gen-4 images use 8 credits per image. Standard and Pro credits don't roll over. Extra credits are sold from 1,000 credits and never expire.\n\n### Who should skip Runway\n\n- **You need a presenter reading a script to camera.** Synthesia or HeyGen do that directly.\n- **You have long recordings to cut into clips.** OpusClip or Descript.\n- **You want to generate video regularly for free.** Runway's free credits are a one-time 125.\n- **You need predictable output on the first try.** Generative video takes iteration, and each try spends credits.\n\n## The alternatives\n\nPrices are the labels on our live [/best/video](https://bestbotfor.com/best/video) page (October 20, 2026). They weren't re-checked on each vendor's site for this guide.\n\n**Synthesia: 90% match.** Script to a talking-head video, which is the product. [Visit Synthesia](https://bestbotfor.com/go/synthesia?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=video)\n\n**HeyGen: 88% match.** Avatar video and translation, without a film crew. [Visit HeyGen](https://bestbotfor.com/go/heygen?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=video)\n\n**Luma Dream Machine: 84% match.** \"$30 and up.\" Strong for cinematic text-to-video and image-to-video. [Visit Luma Dream Machine](https://bestbotfor.com/go/luma-dream-machine?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=video)\n\n**OpusClip: 82% match.** Repurposes podcasts and streams into shorts. [Visit OpusClip](https://bestbotfor.com/go/opus-clip?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=video)\n\n**Descript: 80% match.** Transcript editing is the right model when the recording already exists. [Visit Descript](https://bestbotfor.com/go/descript?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=video)\n\n**Colossyan: 78% match.** Built for L&D teams making training videos. [Visit Colossyan](https://bestbotfor.com/go/colossyan?utm_source=site&utm_medium=guide&utm_campaign=video)\n\n## FAQ\n\n**Is Runway free?** There's a free plan with 125 one-time credits that don't expire. Paid plans start at $12 a month billed yearly ($15 monthly), per runway.com/pricing on October 20, 2026.\n\n**Runway or Synthesia?** Runway generates and alters footage. Synthesia turns a script into a presenter video.\n\n**Did you test these tools?** No. Our scores are research-based, built from vendor pages, docs, leaderboards and published reviews.\n\n## What we checked\n\n- **Vendor pricing:** [runway.com/pricing](https://runway.com/pricing), fetched and rendered October 20, 2026 (ET).\n- **Our live ranking:** [bestbotfor.com/best/video](https://bestbotfor.com/best/video), fetched October 20, 2026. The page shows \"Last reviewed Oct 15, 2026\".\n- **Our catalog and scores:** as of October 20, 2026. Runway review date: October 16, 2026.\n- **Not checked for this guide:** alternative vendors' pricing pages.\n\n## How we rank (read this first)\n\n- **Match** is how well a tool matches this one job in our research. **Our rating** is a separate overall score for the tool against its category. A tool can be the strongest match for a job and still carry a middling overall rating, and we show both.\n- **Scores are research-based, not hands-on testing.** We build them from vendor pricing and product pages, documentation, public leaderboards and published reviews. We did not test these tools ourselves.\n- **Rankings are our own.** Sponsors never affect them, and payment never buys a higher rank. Sponsored placements are labeled and kept out of rankings.\n- **Links:** \"Visit\" links go through bestbotfor.com/go, which logs the click and sends you to the vendor's site. Some of those links may be affiliate links, and we may earn a commission. That never changes our picks or rankings.\n"
